<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Walden Residential cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Walden Residential cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it downgraded Walden Residential Properties Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- the analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- late Monday the company said it expected its second quarter funds from operations to be lower than it earlier anticipated.</p>
<p>-- the stock fell 2-5/16 to 23-9/16.</p>
</text>
